hud-transcription-success = You transcribe the page into your spellbook.
hud-transcription-wrong-class = Only a Mage may transcribe spells.
hud-transcription-no-tome = You need a Tome equipped to transcribe from.
hud-transcription-page-not-in-tome = That page isn't in your equipped Tome.
hud-transcription-already-known = You already know everything on that page.
hud-transcription-mastery-too-low = Your mastery of that magic source isn't high enough yet.
hud-transcription-insufficient-gold = You don't have enough gold.
hud-transcription-insufficient-ink = You don't have enough high-grade arcane ink.
